# 🚚 Supply Chain Analytics Data Warehouse

Supply Chain Analytics platform built using a modern Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold), transforming raw operational data into business-ready datasets for inventory monitoring, sales analysis, and supply chain performance management.

Designed and implemented an end-to-end analytical data pipeline using Python, DuckDB, SQL, and Power BI, covering data ingestion, cleansing, dimensional modeling, KPI generation, and dashboard consumption.

The project simulates a real-world Data Engineering and Analytics Engineering workflow, applying industry best practices for data quality, business modeling, and analytical reporting.

---

# ⚡ TL;DR

📦 Built a complete Supply Chain Data Warehouse

🏗️ Implemented Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold)

🧹 Applied data cleansing and quality controls

📊 Designed dimensional models and analytical fact tables

📈 Created KPI-ready datasets for Power BI dashboards

🗄️ Built using DuckDB, SQL, Python and Pandas

🎯 Focused on inventory, sales, logistics and supply chain analytics

---

# 🎯 Why this project matters

This is not just an ETL exercise.

It simulates a real-world Supply Chain Analytics environment where operational data must be transformed into trusted business information.

The project enables analysis of:

* Inventory availability
* Product sales performance
* Inventory exposure
* Stock movements
* Supply chain operational efficiency
* Inventory risk monitoring

The final Gold layer was designed to support executive dashboards and business decision-making.

---

# 🏗️ Architecture

Medallion Architecture:

```text
Raw Files
    ↓
Bronze Layer
(Raw Data)
    ↓
Silver Layer
(Data Cleansing & Standardization)
    ↓
Gold Layer
(Dimensional Modeling)
    ↓
Power BI Dashboard
```

---

# 🔥 Core Features

## 🥉 Bronze Layer

Raw data ingestion preserving source information.

Tables:

* Inventory Movements
* Inventory Snapshots
* Sales Transactions
* Product Master
* Location Master

Features:

* Source preservation
* Historical traceability
* Minimal transformation

---

## 🥈 Silver Layer

Data quality and standardization layer.

Transformations:

* Text normalization
* Uppercase standardization
* Removal of extra spaces
* Data type conversion
* Date standardization
* Multi-format date handling

Supported formats:

```text
09/01/2026 10:23
10/11/2026
2026-01-10
2026-02-13 09:10
```

---

## 🥇 Gold Layer

Business-oriented analytical model.

Dimensions:

### Dim Product

* ProductSKU
* ProductName
* ProductCategory
* Brand
* UnitCost

### Dim Location

* LocationID
* LocationName
* LocationType
* Region

Facts:

### Fact Sales

Sales transactions and commercial metrics.

### Fact Inventory Movements

Inventory flow and logistics operations.

### Fact Inventory Snapshots

Inventory balances over time.

### Fact Inventory Exposure

Weekly aggregated supply chain performance dataset combining:

* Sales
* Inventory levels
* Inventory movements

