---

# 🧪 Data Quality Controls

Implemented several quality assurance mechanisms:

✔ Safe date conversion using TRY_CAST and TRY_STRPTIME

✔ Multiple date format support

✔ Standardized business keys

✔ Null-safe transformations

✔ Text normalization

✔ Consistent dimensional relationships

---

# ⚠️ Real Challenges Solved

### Mixed Date Formats

The source datasets contained multiple date patterns:

```text
09/01/2026 10:23
10/11/2026
2026-01-10
2026-02-13 09:10
```

✔ Solved by implementing multi-format parsing logic using:

* TRY_CAST
* TRY_STRPTIME
* COALESCE

---

### Data Standardization

Source data contained inconsistencies across:

* SKU identifiers
* Location identifiers
* Product descriptions

✔ Solved by implementing standardization rules in the Silver Layer.

---

### Analytical Modeling

Operational datasets were not suitable for reporting.

✔ Solved by creating a dimensional model with:

* Fact tables
* Dimension tables
* Business-friendly naming conventions

